WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.000
Follow military orders.

00:15.240 --> 00:16.640
Fire arrows.

00:21.400 --> 00:22.800
Fire arrows.

00:27.240 --> 00:28.640
No.

00:34.440 --> 00:39.360
Hurry move forward hurry, no retreat, retreat and die.

00:43.480 --> 00:45.080
Archers ready.

00:51.960 --> 00:57.480
The northern expedition may one day succeed but they will never see it.

00:58.040 --> 01:02.760
Blood fills the air below the walls Your throat tightens Your stomach churns.

01:02.840 --> 01:07.680
But you remain on the city walls you know for the rest of your life.

01:07.760 --> 01:12.520
You will never forget today's scene when the time comes to drive out the Wuzhao.

01:12.600 --> 01:14.560
You will repay them a hundredfold.

01:15.920 --> 01:17.320
Fire arrows.

01:51.640 --> 01:53.360
Fire arrows.

01:54.500 --> 02:03.500
Wu Junren drove waves of displaced refugees against the city walls for three days straight. The defending troops atop the walls showed no mercy, and the corpses of the refugees mingled with dirt and stones, piling into a marsh of flesh and blood beneath the city walls...

